sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-przemyslaw-allometric-compound-leaf> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-przemyslaw-allometric-compound-leaf-model-fidelity> .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-przemyslaw-allometric-compound-leaf-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Bilsborough et al. (2011), Barkoulas et al. (2008), Vlad et al. (2014) & Kierzkowski et al. (2019) growing leaf margin PIN1-Auxin-CUC2-RCO feedback loop: emergent integrated-contour dissection, growing cellular spring-lattice lamina with Mitchison-canalized veins and microtubule-anisotropic growth, and Cardamine hirsuta specimen segmentation — Model fidelity to source: 72/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Loops 1-3 of Bilsborough et al. (2011) are implemented as exact algebraic laws on a 1D margin profile (L154-317), the margin contour is now genuinely integrated from the Loop 3 outgrowth velocity (`integrate_margin_outgrowth`, L417-475; emergent I_D L476-523) and the new `GrowingLaminaSpringMesh` (L654-1137) is a real overdamped elastic solver (Hookean springs + area penalty, L999-1025) with rest-length growth from an anisotropic tensor (L1027-1065), a screened-Poisson growth field (L872-887), Mitchison canalization on sparse linear solves (L905-927) and a flux-connected vein topology check (L929-947); 5 Lean 4 theorems (3 v2 + Hamant partition L164-192 + Mitchison feedback L206-224) mirror the code. Deductions: the auxin convergence peaks are a prescribed Gaussian template (L198-216; disclosed L187-194), so Loop 1 is verified only as an identity and tooth number/spacing are inputs (-10); the remediation asked for a 3D FE vertex mesh and the delivered lamina is 2D, without thickness, division or adaxial/abaxial layers (-8); the stress-feedback lamina anisotropy is implemented (L985-990) but disabled by default (a_lamina = 0.0, L706) because it destabilised the explicit relaxation (-5); the equal-duration growth law cannot produce leaflet-level dissection (sweep ceiling 0.427, L1186-1215) (-5)." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "2011-przemyslaw-allometric-compound-leaf.py L187–L216: HONESTY NOTE and convergence_drive: auxin peaks are prescribed Gaussians at u = +-0.22 k; PIN1 up-the-gradient transport is not solved <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/2011-przemyslaw-allometric-compound-leaf.py#L187-L216>",
            "2011-przemyslaw-allometric-compound-leaf.py L705–L706: a_vein = 0.20 but a_lamina = 0.0: the Sampathkumar (2014) stress-feedback channel is switched off by default <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/2011-przemyslaw-allometric-compound-leaf.py#L705-L706>" ;
        pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-przemyslaw-allometric-compound-leaf-model-fidelity-1>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-przemyslaw-allometric-compound-leaf-model-fidelity-2>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-przemyslaw-allometric-compound-leaf-model-fidelity-3> ;
        pk:hasScore "0.72"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "mostly faithful" .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-przemyslaw-allometric-compound-leaf-model-fidelity-1> a pk:EvidenceItem ;
        rdfs:label "2011-przemyslaw-allometric-compound-leaf.py L417–L523" ;
        dct:description "integrate_margin_outgrowth: material-polyline radial-growth integrator (rate k_allometric + kappa_n * (v_n - <v_n>), outward normal term, arclength resampling) and dissection_index_radial (find_peaks on log R, I_D = 0 when no lateral tooth)" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/2011-przemyslaw-allometric-compound-leaf.py#L417-L523> .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-przemyslaw-allometric-compound-leaf-model-fidelity-2> a pk:EvidenceItem ;
        rdfs:label "2011-przemyslaw-allometric-compound-leaf.py L654–L1137" ;
        dct:description "GrowingLaminaSpringMesh: symmetric half-mesh Delaunay + mirror (L738-863), screened-Poisson growth field, Mitchison canalization (L905-927), vein topology (L929-947), anisotropic growth tensors (L949-997), relaxation (L999-1025), run/summary" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/2011-przemyslaw-allometric-compound-leaf.py#L654-L1137> .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-przemyslaw-allometric-compound-leaf-model-fidelity-3> a pk:EvidenceItem ;
        rdfs:label "morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_037_allometric_compound_leaf.lean L164–L224" ;
        dct:description "hamant_2008_microtubule_anisotropic_growth_partition (gamma_par + gamma_perp = 2gS, gamma_par - gamma_perp = 2gaS > 0) and mitchison_1980_canalization_conductance_feedback (D' > D above threshold, D' < D at zero flux); file verifies with 0 sorrys" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_037_allometric_compound_leaf.lean#L164-L224> .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Claude Fable 5.1 (MorphoEval Autonomous Loop Slot 037 Pass 3 Assessor)" ;
        dct:identifier "claude-fable-5-1" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf <https://orcid.org/0009-0007-4948-9192> ;
        foaf:homepage <https://www.anthropic.com> .
}

